      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUBBA NAY (5) was ultra-impressive at her latest appearance over 2100m at Young, scoring comfortably by 12 metres after taking control of the race a fair way from home. Taking on a better line-up this time but she is good enough to play a major role. A LIL BIT OF LOVE (7) finished third last time out, beaten 7 metres, in a far better performance at Young over 2100m. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. This looks a sterner test than last time but she is capable of another big performance. JUDAH RED (2) was runner-up fresh before breaking last start. Has trialled twice since and draws well. Major player with manners. BARLOR HEAVEN (8) last appeared when eighth over 2040m at Redcliffe five months ago. Expect a better effort to kick off this prep. STUDLEIGH SUNRISE (3) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance at Parkes.",
